	(text "J1 = 9 V supply, J2 = signal in, J3 = signal out (inverted, ~150x).\nR1/R2 set the base bias; R4 stabilises Ic; C2 bypasses R4 for AC gain.\nC1/C3 block DC at input and output; C5 is bulk supply decoupling." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 60.96 124 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dadaff11-9c50-5638-863d-aba01cd57776"))
